{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261012/photo/bkn-20261012210123042-1012_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261012225616\"/><p>事發錦達閣一單位。（陳嘉傑攝）</p><p>今晚(12日)8時59分，馬鞍山錦英路錦英苑錦達閣，一名男子疑因洗手間漏水，他低頭維修期間突然暈倒，兒子發現後報案。救護車趕至將男子送往威爾斯親王醫院搶救，惜於晚上10時03分返魂乏術。警員到場調查男子猝死原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T14:59:23.938219+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T13:01:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T14:57:46.207385+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:57:46.207385+00:00","content_hash":"3824ca02923dbafa2fbcbde4cab1562e9d36c8182872dc3ac7b09edf9efda518","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}